{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/f793f3f51ec171d3ec05825042567086.poster.avif?t=1766810774\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/f793f3f51ec171d3ec05825042567086.webm?t=1766810774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/f793f3f51ec171d3ec05825042567086.mp4?t=1766810774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content of this game lasts approximately 90 minutes or more, offering a fun and interactive visual novel experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will solve puzzles, complete tasks, and advance the storyline through basic mouse operations like clicking and dragging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to purchase this game without hesitation. It\u2019s not too long, and if you don\u2019t like it after playing, you can always request a refund and recommend it to your mischievous friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if you find the game enjoyable, please don\u2019t refund it\u2014recommend it to your good friends instead. I\u2019m so broke, QAQ!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/fe477c0b96450ba1a1f851aeee48bdb9.poster.avif?t=1766810774\" width=264 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/fe477c0b96450ba1a1f851aeee48bdb9.webm?t=1766810774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/fe477c0b96450ba1a1f851aeee48bdb9.mp4?t=1766810774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outstanding Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Adorable shota and furry characters, along with their pure and passionate friendships.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich and engaging interactive elements, such as simulating petting a puppy or washing off dust...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An emotionally moving storyline with dual endings.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Completed chapters can be replayed, allowing you to unlock different endings with minimal effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/1155ea91ab55509c82af3a73eee1f721.poster.avif?t=1766810774\" width=810 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/1155ea91ab55509c82af3a73eee1f721.webm?t=1766810774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/extras/1155ea91ab55509c82af3a73eee1f721.mp4?t=1766810774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Plot:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A street-dwelling young man named Akuro endured constant bullying until the treasure hunter Bahaku appeared and took him on a journey. Under Bahaku's guidance, Akuro gradually learned how to explore ancient ruins and became a capable treasure hunter in his own right. Their friendship grew stronger with each passing day. However, one day, they uncovered a hidden secret within the ancient ruins...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738940?t=1766810774","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738940/9df9923a1e5b2b6a24c4168cc61dca25f777f9a5